\par\par \b \uc2 Technology & Business: \uc2 Groupon\uc2  to Slash Up to 400 Positions\b0\par\par\uc2 By Connor Hart \par \uc2 256 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 May 2026\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B4\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Groupon\uc2  will lay off nearly a quarter of its employees, cutting up to 400 positions globally in a restructuring the company said will advance its previously disclosed strategy to rebuild as an AI-native company.\par \par \uc2 The online marketplace company said Tuesday that it expected to record between $7 million and $13 million in pretax charges tied to the restructuring, the majority of which it anticipated would stem from employee severance and compensation benefits.\par \par \uc2 Most of the job cuts are expected to occur by the end of the third quarter, \uc2 Groupon\uc2  said.\par \par \uc2 Groupon\uc2  estimated the layoffs will result in up to $25 million in annualized cost savings. The company expects to realize $10 million to $12 million of the savings this year and plans to reinvest about half of that money into marketing, artificial-intelligence infrastructure and talent density.\par \par \uc2 The company continues to evaluate other cost-reduction and automation actions, it added.\par \par \uc2 Groupon\uc2  had 1,734 total employees as of Dec. 31, according to the most recent head count available in filings with the \uc2 Securities and Exchange Commission\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As a result of the restructuring efforts, \uc2 Groupon\uc2  lifted its full-year outlook for adjusted earnings before interest, taxes, depreciation and amortization to between $75 million and $80 million, up from between $70 million and $75 million.\par \par \uc2 Shares climbed 9.4% to $20.71 in Tuesday's trading.\par \par \uc2 Groupon\uc2  separately said its chief operating officer, \uc2 Jiri Ponrt\uc2 , notified the company of his decision to resign, effective July 10.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020260527em5r00013\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
