\par\par \b \uc2 Nike\uc2  to Cut Workers By 2%, Mostly in Tech\b0\par\par\uc2 By Inti Pacheco \par \uc2 291 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 April 2026\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B3\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2026 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Nike\uc2  will reduce its workforce by 1,400 workers, or 2%, as part of a plan to simplify global operations.\par \par \uc2 The reduction will mostly affect employees in \uc2 Nike\uc2 's technology department, the company said Thursday.\par \par \uc2 "This is not a new direction. It is the next phase of the work already under way," said Chief Operations Officer \uc2 Venkatesh Alagirisamy\uc2  in a note to employees.\par \par \uc2 The layoffs come as the sneaker maker works through the turnaround plan laid out by \uc2 Nike\uc2  Chief Executive \uc2 Elliott Hill\uc2 . The company cut about 800 workers in January and it said in March it expected to record a $300 million charge related to cost cutting.\par \par \uc2 The Beaverton, Ore., company had 77,800 employees as of May of last year.\par \par \uc2 It has been struggling with increasing competition and slower consumer demand for its products. The company has made some progress mending relationships with retailers in the U.S., where sales have improved. But it has faced challenges in China, in particular.\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, \uc2 Nike\uc2  shares fell to their lowest level in more than a decade after company executives forecast lower revenue for the year and warned that sales in China could fall as much as 20% for the quarter ending May 31. Its stock has fallen 30% since the start of the year.\par \par \uc2 Nike\uc2  said it would reshape its technology team and streamline processes in its Beaverton manufacturing facility that works with its proprietary Air technology.\par \par \uc2 The sneaker maker will move some of the Converse footwear manufacturing resources closer to factory partners, and it will reorganize how its materials supply chain operates.\par \par \uc2 Alagirisamy said in his note the changes were meant to make the company more responsive.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020260424em4o0001y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
